# > Tato core / historical server IPs
IP-CIDR,3.33.191.160/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,13.212.189.11/32,no-resolve
IP-CIDR,13.212.116.79/32,no-resolve

# > Tato core TCP port
# Important: catches hard-coded / rotated server IPs
